# <%= projectName %>

This project was created from Putnami's **experimental** `python-server`
template. Python is an explicit opt-in path: it is not a default project type
and has no feature or compatibility parity promise with Go or TypeScript.

The template provides only a minimal FastAPI entrypoint, uvicorn configuration,
and a request test. Treat it as a starting point for an experiment, validate
its dependencies and runtime behavior in your environment, and add production
concerns deliberately.

## Run locally

```bash
putnami serve <%= projectName %>
```

## Verify

```bash
putnami lint,test <%= projectName %>
```

## Documentation

This README is the project's entry point. Put longer pages under `doc/` and
link them from here: `putnami lint` fails on a relative link or an anchor that
does not resolve.
